ends using polymers, preventing the split from traveling further up the hair shaft.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-is-intensive-repair-shampoo-suitable-for-oily-scalps\">Is intensive repair shampoo suitable for oily scalps?<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Yes, with the right technique.<\/strong> Many people suffer from &#8220;oily roots and dry ends.&#8221; We recommend the &#8220;Double Wash&#8221; method: Use a clarifying shampoo for the first wash to clean the scalp, and use the <strong>Intensive Repair Shampoo<\/strong> for the second wash, focusing primarily on the mid-lengths and ends.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/10007.jpg\" alt=\"Chinese shampoo factory\" class=\"wp-image-2197\" srcset=\"https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/10007.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/10007-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/10007-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion: Start Your Hair Resurrection Journey Today<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">An <strong>Intensive Repair Shampoo<\/strong> is more than just a cleanser\u2014it is the bridge between damaged, unmanageable hair and the healthy, glowing locks your customers crave.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In a market saturated with empty promises, quality formulas and proven ingredients are the only metrics that matter. Whether you are looking to save your own hair or seeking a reliable <strong>Private Label<\/strong> manufacturer to launch your own brand, we are here to help.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Do you want to access our exclusive Intensive Repair Shampoo formulas?<\/strong> Or are you l